727	      // wildcard can't cover them and the `*.<base>` A record doesn't resolve them —
728	      // so an --expand reissue here would only burn LE quota. Skip entirely when the
729	      // wildcard is enabled; flag off ⇒ the SAN-expansion flow below runs as before.
730	      if (hostingWildcardEnabled() && isFreeSubdomain(primary)) continue;
